Welcome to Meta Clinic.

Create your platform-owner password using this private link:

<%= @activation_url %>

The link expires at <%= @expires_at.in_time_zone("America/Chicago").strftime("%B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p %Z") %> and can be used once.

After you create your password, Meta Clinic will sign you in and open the Owner Command Center.

If you did not request this account, do not use the link.
